Error [E0104]: `spawn` needs a zero-parameter lambda, got 1 parameter
  --> tests/ui/task_spawn_parameters.jet:4:25
    |
  4 |     val t = tasks.spawn((x: Int) => x);
    |                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: a task starts by calling the lambda with no arguments
 Fix: move data into the task with `take(name)` instead of lambda parameters
